{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02776","headline":"赠益府羣官 · 卢照邻","name":"赠益府羣官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一鸟自北燕，飞来向西蜀。\n单栖剑门上，独舞岷山足。\n昂藏多古貌，哀怨有新曲。\n羣凤从之游，问之何所欲？\n荅言寒乡子，飘颻万余里。\n不息恶木枝，不饮盗泉水。\n常思稻粱遇，愿栖梧桐树。\n智者不我邀，愚夫余不顾。\n所以成独立，耿耿岁云暮。\n日夕苦风霜，思归赴洛阳。\n羽翮毛衣短，关山道路长。\n明月流客思，白云迷故乡。\n谁能借风便，一举凌苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}